    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSpacious 3 bed duplex in excellent decorative repair and condition throughout. Located in a popular residential area close to all local amenities and within 1 hour commute of Dublin city centre.Accommodation comprises:Entrance HallKitchen/DiningLiving roomGuest WC3 double bedrooms (one ensuite)Main bathroomBalcony off the living room Property is let UNFURNISHED.**Enquiries via the 'contact agent' link ONLY due to the expected high level of interest**"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nTiled floor, radiator cover, understairs storage, alarm key pad and recessed lighting.\n\nGuest Toilet - \nTiled floor. w.c. w.h.b. tiled floor.\n\nKitchen / Diningroom - \nFitted cream wall and floor units with integrated fridge freezer, Hotpoint dishwasher, Hotpoint dishwasher, Hotpoint washing machine and free standing cooker with double oven. Tiled over countertop. Tiled floor. Coving and recessed lighting with dimmer switch.\n\nSitting Room - \nWalnut laminate wood floor. Radiator cover. Electric fire insert with cream fire surround. Fitted cupboard with gas fired boiler. French doors leading out to wooden decked balcony with afternoon sun. Coving and recessed lighting with dimmer switch.\n\nLanding - \nRadiator cover. Access to attic space with Stira which is partially floored for storage. Hotpress with insulated cylinder and immersion.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nFitted wardrobes with mirrored doors and drawer unit.\n\nEn-Suite - \nw.c. w.h.b. Trition T9Z electric shower. Heated towel rail. Carpeted floor.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nFitted wardrobes. French doors open onto wooden decked balcony.\n\nBedroom 3 - \nFitted wardrobes. Carpeted floors.\n\nBathroom - \nw.c. and w.h.b. with mirror over and feature light. Panelled bath with mixer shower. large heated towel rail. Partly tiled walls and tiled floor.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>All mains services are provided </li><li>Natural gas central heating - boiler with split control unit </li><li>Intruder alarm</li><li>Smoke alarms connected to mains</li><li>Bin tidy shed </li><li>1 parking space</ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B3\nBER No: 110203353\nEnergy Performance Indicator: 147.68"
      },
